  "_readme": [
    "Seed copy shipped inside the APK so a fresh install works offline.",
    "At runtime the app fetches a newer copy from RemoteConfig.CATALOG_URL every 7 days.",
    "storeSources is an ordered fallback chain: the first source that yields stores wins.",
    "Unknown 'type' values are skipped rather than treated as errors, so a future catalog",
    "can introduce a new source type and older installs fall through to the next one.",
    "BuyMe entries were generated from the live endpoint by tools/CatalogGen; only the",
    "largest few carry a bundled_asset, the rest fetch on first use to keep the APK small."
  ],

